<title>UK: EMAP buys Top Sante's British publishers.</title>
<headline>EMAP buys Top Sante's British publishers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>British media and exhibitions group EMAP Plc said on Tuesday its unit EMAP Consumer Magazines Ltd had bought Presse Publishing Ltd, publishers of the British edition of Top Sante magazine.</p>
<p>EMAP said the next assets of PPL at the end of last year totalled 254,000 stg. It did not say how much the deal cost.</p>
<p>EMAP said Top Sante would be published in Britain by EMAP Elan. EMAP already publishes the magazine in France, Belgium. It has a joint venture in Holland.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
